    { "id": "yb001", "type": "single", "content": "在 JavaScript 中，以下哪个关键字用于声明一个不可被重新赋值的变量？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "var", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "let", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "const", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 3, "text": "static", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "const 声明常量，不能被重新赋值。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb002", "type": "single", "content": "JavaScript 中，typeof null 的返回值是什么？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "null", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "undefined", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "object", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 3, "text": "NaN", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "这是JS著名的遗留Bug。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb003", "type": "single", "content": "以下代码中，console.log(a) 的输出是什么？\nlet a = 10;\nfunction foo() {\n  console.log(a);\n  let a = 20;\n}\nfoo();", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "10", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "20", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "undefined", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "ReferenceError", "isCorrect": true }], "explanation": "let存在暂时性死区（TDZ）。", "difficulty": 2 },
    { "id": "yb004", "type": "single", "content": "下面哪种方式可以正确创建一个 JavaScript 对象？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "let obj = { name: \"Tom\", age: 18 };", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 1, "text": "let obj = (name=\"Tom\", age=18);", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "let obj = struct { string name; int age; };", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "let obj = [\"Tom\", 18];", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "JS对象用{}表示。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb005", "type": "single", "content": "JavaScript 中，Promise 主要用于解决什么问题？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "内存泄漏", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "异步编程", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 2, "text": "类型检查", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "DOM操作", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "Promise解决回调地狱问题。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb006", "type": "single", "content": "在 JavaScript 中，以下表达式的结果是 true 的是？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "\"10\" == 10", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 1, "text": "\"10\" === 10", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "null === undefined", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "NaN === NaN", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "==会进行隐式类型转换。", "difficulty": 2 },
    { "id": "yb007", "type": "single", "content": "要将一个 JavaScript 对象转换为 JSON 字符串，应使用哪个方法？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "JSON.parse(obj)", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "JSON.stringify(obj)", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 2, "text": "obj.toString()", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "String(obj)", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "stringify序列化，parse用于解析。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb008", "type": "single", "content": "在浏览器中，document.getElementById(\"app\") 返回的是什么？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "HTML字符串", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "DOM对象", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 2, "text": "jQuery对象", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 3, "text": "数组", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "返回DOM元素对象。", "difficulty": 1 },
    { "id": "yb009", "type": "single", "content": "关于 JavaScript 的数组，以下说法正确的是？", "options": [{ "id": 0, "text": "数组中只能存放同一种类型的数据", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 1, "text": "数组长度一旦定义就不能改变", "isCorrect": false }, { "id": 2, "text": "数组是一种特殊的对象", "isCorrect": true }, { "id": 3, "text": "JavaScript数组本质上是连续内存", "isCorrect": false }], "explanation": "JS数组本质是对象，长度动态可变。", "difficulty": 1 },
